  m_text: "<b>\U0001F4A1 Tips</b>  \r\n\u2022 Only the attacker can slash  \r\n\u2022
    Only the defender can dodge or catch  \r\n\u2022 Dodging avoids damage but doesn\u2019t
    change roles  \r\n\u2022 Catching is risky but lets you take control  \r\n\u2022
    You have limited lives \u2014 be careful!"
